Age of AI's personality files (.eeai)
=====================================

The files in this folder are copied unchanged from Grille's "Empire Earth: Age of AI", upstream commit
7a17182b (2026-11-23), folder `config/personalities/`:

    _template.eeai      an empty personality with every key, to copy
    baumeister.eeai     Hedda, the master builder
    eroberer.eeai       Temur, the steppe conqueror
    fuchs.eeai          Livia, the scheming princess
    haendler.eeai       Benedict, the merchant prince
    hitzkopf.eeai       Brann, the hot-headed chieftain
    ritter.eeai         Gunther, the honourable knight
    README.md           the format, the expressions and every situation (the mod's own documentation)

