These files are the mod's texts, not this repository's, and are kept as they are: edit the upstream files, not
these copies.

This engine has no .eeai loader. `tools/personas.py` reads the files next to this NOTICE and writes
`data/ai/ageofai/personas_data.lua`, the persona table `ageofai.personas` loads (`python tools/personas.py
--write`; `--check` fails while the generated file is behind). It reads the `personality` record and the `lines`
record, and nothing else: the mod's own base layers (`mod/computer.eeai`, `mod/prompt.eeai`,
`mod/system.eeai`, `mod/units.eeai`) and the files that include them are not vendored, because this port does not
run the retail mod's line system. The conditions in the files are not evaluated: the generated table holds the
unconditional line of each situation, with `{placeholders}` stripped, as the tool's header explains.

Upstream: https://github.com/Grille/Empire-Earth-Age-of-AI (GPL-3.0).
